description	"Dagos Rudemo

^2Weaponry:
- Enhanced Melee (1)

^8Attributes:
- Inhuman Strength [Melee Knockback]
- Heal (1)

^3Abilities:
- Jump great heights (3)
- Telekinesis Push and Pull (3)
- Essence drain from other clones (2)
- Undetectable (3)
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]

Dagos Rudemo, test subject 0277. 0277 is the fourth of five powerful clones that we have engineered. Out of the first three, he has the most abilities, subject X thanks him for them and has offered to kill him for us as he seems to think it’ll be a waste of a good fight but under protocol we cannot allow this. 0277 has; Powerful strength, the ability to pull and push living beings and if pull is mixed with push, can often kill people. He also has make himself invisible to the weak minded, drain the power out of other clones and jump great heights. He has one other ability one of which subject X wants but cannot have; He is untraceable, he blocks our scanners and also blocks X’s powerful glare. During these tests we’ve been able to make use of his strength genome and upgraded our Elite Storm Troopers with powerful melee."